# Running the observer from this directory writes bytecode beside it, and a
# `git add -A` in a worktree will commit it -- which is exactly how
# arm_observe.cpython-312.pyc reached main in 86f6ad0f.
#
# Scoped here, inside .ledge/, ON PURPOSE. The root .gitignore is NOT in
# test.yml's paths-ignore, so editing it would fire Test on main and dispatch
# the asana service deploy. A nested ignore under .ledge/** does the same job
# and stays deploy-inert.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
